    <div class="offer__head">
      <h2>Keep your favorite format within reach.</h2>
      <p>Pick how you want to buy. The price, the count, the price per gummy, and the renewal terms are all right here.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="offer__layout">
      <figure class="offer__visual" data-tier="5">
