<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <h2>Questions people ask before the first pouch.</h2>
    <div class="faq__list">
      <details><summary>What is in the gummies?</summary><p>Natural kratom leaf extract from Mitragyna speciosa, standardized to 35 mg of mitragynine per gummy, in a soft pectin gummy with mixed berry flavor and a sugar coating. The full ingredient list and the supplement facts panel are printed on the pouch and on the product page.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How is kratom dose&#8209;dependent?</summary><p>The same plant tends to feel different at different amounts. Smaller amounts lean toward energy and focus. Larger amounts lean toward body ease and relaxation. Everyone responds a little differently, so start with the amount on the pouch and pay attention to how one gummy sits with you.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How is the batch tested?</summary><p>Every batch goes to an independent lab and is tested for identity, potency, heavy metals, and microbials. The results for the current batch are posted on our <a href="{{ coa_url }}">lab reports page</a>.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Where is the batch number?</summary><p>On the pouch. Match it against the <a href="{{ coa_url }}">lab reports page</a> to see the results for the exact batch you are holding.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What is the difference between gummies, capsules, and powder?</summary><p>Same plant, different format. Powder needs measuring and mixing and tastes bitter. Capsules skip the taste but still need water and are not much of a treat. A gummy is a fixed amount you can eat anywhere, and it tastes like mixed berry.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Who can buy Dandy?</summary><p>Adults 21 and older. We verify age at checkout.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Where does Dandy ship?</summary><p>Within the United States, to states where kratom is legal. <a href="{{ ship_url }}">Check your state</a> before you order; if we cannot ship to your address, checkout will tell you before you pay.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What is the money-back guarantee?</summary><p>If you do not get on with the flavor or the format, email support within 30 days of delivery and we refund you. No forms, no return shipping.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

